  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.5: IAuthorizationContext and ICurrentUser carry the caller's account type. AccountType is the auderz.account_type claim (User, Worker or a staff type, null for machine tokens) and IsStaff is the Identity Provider's rule: an account type that is neither User nor Worker. The claim name is the new Auderz:Authorization:AccountTypeClaimType option (default auderz.account_type), and AuderzAccountTypes holds the names and the IsCustomer, IsWorker, IsMarketplace and IsStaff helpers. Both interface members have default bodies, so existing implementations keep compiling. No configuration change needed. Also ships Spanish (es) and Portuguese (pt) in AuderzLocales, added after 1.2.4 was published.",
